,"8:14":"The seeds that fell among the thorns are those who hear, but as they go on their way, they are choked by the worries, riches, and pleasures of this life, and their fruit does not mature.","8:15":"But the seeds on good soil are those with a noble and good heart, who hear the word, cling to it, and by persevering produce a crop."}}},"pairs":{"mt-mk":{"exact":54,"lemma":25,"pctA":61.2,"pctB":54.1,"run":7,"runText":"θλίψεως ἢ διωγμοῦ διὰ τὸν λόγον εὐθὺς"},"mt-lk":{"exact":20,"lemma":26,"pctA":35.7,"pctB":42.2,"run":4,"runText":"δὲ εἰς τὰς ἀκάνθας"},"mk-lk":{"exact":33,"lemma":13,"pctA":31.5,"pctB":42.2,"run":4,"runText":"καὶ αἴρει τὸν λόγον"}},"minor":[{"mt":25,"lk":30,"l":2,"word":"καρδίᾳ","gloss":"heart","content":1,"sig":1},{"mt":26,"lk":31,"l":2,"word":"αὐτοῦ","gloss":"of him","content":0,"sig":1},{"mt":41,"lk":17,"l":2,"word":"ἐστιν","gloss":"is","content":1,"sig":1},{"mt":72,"lk":64,"l":3,"word":"δὲ","gloss":"now","content":0,"sig":0},{"mt":107,"lk":93,"l":2,"word":"οὗτός","gloss":"this","content":0,"sig":0}]}